+## Configurable articulated MuJoCo execution
+
+When a task needs an articulated human or another named joint model, inspect
+`docs/configurable-mujoco.md` and `forma_core/control/mujoco_adapter.py` before
+adding an adapter. Author the MJCF tree, axis/body/joint bindings, optional pinned
+HumanIR participant, contact switches and fixed attachments as JSON outside
+repository source. Use `forma_core.control.mujoco_run` to send the declared
+transcript through MachineRuntime, then `forma_core.control.mujoco_render` to
+render the recorded states. The renderer does not execute motion. Keep thermal,
+electrical, biomechanics and physical safety claims separate from joint/contact
+simulation. Do not repurpose robot-specific adapters or add benchmark conditionals.
